# Vision Statement

Aura exists to make technology disappear.

Smart homes have become increasingly powerful, but also increasingly fragmented. Every manufacturer provides its own application, interface and workflow, forcing users to constantly switch between apps to complete even the simplest tasks.

Aura changes that.

Aura is not another remote control.

Aura is a unified experience that transforms a collection of smart devices into one intelligent home.

Instead of controlling products, Aura controls moments.

---

# Mission

Create the most beautiful, intelligent and effortless smart home control experience available on iPhone.

Aura should become the single application users instinctively open whenever they interact with their home.

---

# Product Philosophy

Technology should never be the focus.

The home should be.

Users should never think:

"I need to open the Philips app."

or

"I need the Apple TV remote."

Instead they should simply think:

"I want to watch a movie."

Aura handles everything else.

---

# Core Idea

Every interaction inside Aura should answer one simple question:

"What is the user trying to experience?"

Never:

"What device are they trying to control?"

Aura controls experiences.

Not hardware.

---

# Product Principles

## 1. Invisible Technology

The best interface is the one the user never notices.

Technology should quietly work in the background while the experience stays in focus.

---

## 2. One Touch

The most common actions should require one tap.

If a task regularly needs three or more taps, the experience should be redesigned.

---

## 3. Context First

Aura should always understand context.

Examples:

• Which room is currently active

• Which TV input is selected

• Whether someone is watching a movie

• Time of day

• Current lighting

• Previous behaviour

The interface adapts accordingly.

---

## 4. Calm Design

Aura should never feel stressful.

No flashing elements.

No unnecessary notifications.

No aggressive colors.

No visual clutter.

The interface should feel calm, premium and timeless.

---

## 5. Local First

Whenever technically possible:

Everything happens locally.

No cloud dependency.

No unnecessary user data leaves the home.

Privacy is a feature.

---

## 6. Intelligent Automation

Automation should feel invisible.

Aura never forces automation.

Aura simply makes intelligent suggestions.

Examples:

"Movie Night?"

"Continue Gaming?"

"Good Night?"

The user always remains in control.

